  "notes": "Maximum plot ratio (A2.5.1); N/A = null (no provision, NOT_APPLICABLE). Extract 'N/A N/A 4.0 6.0 7.0' = low-rise | mid-rise | HR1 | HR2 | HR3. Note 6: plot ratio per the definitions (plot ratio area exclusions). Rows also match the current names (R-AC4 = LR1, R-AC3 = MR2, R-AC1 = HR1, R-AC0 = R-PA; register C4P2-017). R-AC2 has no column and no row. The generic LR, MR and HR bands have no row (MR and HR each span columns with different values), so a site coded only LR, MR or HR is NOT_APPLICABLE until its code is known.",
